    "Id": "mechdef_arcticcheetah_E",
    "Name": "Arctic Cheetah -- Hankyu",
    "Details": "Designed first and foremost to crush infantry and battle armor squads, the Alternative Configuration E of the Arctic Cheetah does so thanks to many focused technologies.  First each arm is equipped with 3 clan light machine guns (LMGs) arrayed together to increase damage and grouping.  1/2 ton of MG Ammunition is in each arm to support the arrays.   Two Medium Pulse Lasers provide firepower to take on other mechs and two B-Pods prevent enemy Battle Armor from clinging onto this mech.  The Nearly ubiquitous Flamer that is seen on almost al Arctic Cheetah variants is included as well.",
    "Icon": "Hankyu"
